content.text:
Done. The "Changes & Sync" tab now automatically refreshes when you switch to it after making template changes.

**What I added:**

```typescript
// Auto-refresh when switching to Changes & Sync tab after template changes
const prevActiveTab = useRef(activeTab);
useEffect(() => {
  if (prevActiveTab.current === 'studio' && activeTab === 'reconciler') {
    // Just switched from Template Studio to Changes & Sync - refresh
    handleScan();
  }
  prevActiveTab.current = activeTab;
}, [activeTab]);
```

Now when you:
1. Make changes in the **Edit Template** tab (add/rename/delete folders)
2. Click on **Changes & Sync** tab

The scan runs automatically and shows the updated differences immediately — no manual refresh needed.
